recommend check-in (Claude) max_name is the clean next lap for this lane and the card now names it -- the last Tablecloth bound without a desk, and the one %354 proved carries an alphabet as well as a length, so its pedestal names two facts where the others name one. Two things above my hand: the uid leg of Hush's door probe is Pond behind gate %5, and the brush-parse desk's literal example    13 belongs to whoever owns src_first_resident_witness.rish. One question worth a ruling rather than a lap: %358 showed the QA card scoring a reading it could not take, and register already reports rather than scores below its floor -- whether reach should do the same below its own hundred-word floor is a change to a shared instrument's arithmetic, and I fixed only the blindness rather than the asymmetry.
